Subject: A sign-in method was removed from your Steerpost account

--- text ---
GitHub can no longer be used to sign in to your Steerpost account.

If this was not you, someone may have access to your account: sign in, change your password and check Settings → Sign-in methods. Review your account here: https://app.example.com/verify-email#token=abc123

Steerpost

