<!doctype html>
<html><body style="font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.5;color:#111">
<p>GitHub can no longer be used to sign in to your Steerpost account.</p>
<p>If this was not you, someone may have access to your account: sign in, change your password and check Settings → Sign-in methods. <a href="https://app.example.com/verify-email#token=abc123">Review your account</a>.</p>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px">Steerpost</p>
</body></html>
